RT-DETRv3 PyTorch

This distribution contains source code adapted from the following
Apache-2.0-licensed projects:

- RT-DETRv3, https://github.com/clxia12/RT-DETRv3,
  revision 349e7d99a5065e7b684118912e6a74178d4f4625.
- PaddleDetection, https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleDetection.
- D-FINE, https://github.com/Peterande/D-FINE,
  revision 267a6da6d04c8ad52e54120692896515b9e55981, Apache-2.0.
- DEIM, https://github.com/Intellindust-AI-Lab/DEIM,
  revision 09d35d53d39ee3145a1e61e3a989b28b9468d1dd, Apache-2.0.
- RT-DETRv4, https://github.com/RT-DETRs/RT-DETRv4,
  revision 55fefaaed7efe2a5f72d0a18fd4e05965e35c292, Apache-2.0.

Copyright and attribution notices from those projects are retained in the
individual source files. The official and converted model checkpoints are not
included in the Python wheel or source distribution. Their provenance,
checksums, and hosting boundaries are recorded in configs/checkpoints/.

RT-DETRv4 training can optionally use facebookresearch/DINOv3,
https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov3, revision
346f38fee679c56a6888f91c51670fae61d364e0. DINOv3 is governed by the custom
DINOv3 License at
https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov3/blob/346f38fee679c56a6888f91c51670fae61d364e0/LICENSE.md.
Its source checkout and Meta-gated weights are external training assets. They
are not included in this distribution and are not redistributed by this
project. Users must obtain authorized access from Meta and comply with the
DINOv3 License and acknowledgment requirements.
